.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106270/extras/6485ba5349b4fde1faa2175f8a1a0164.mp4?t=1789835931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >展开故事</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每一次冒险都独一无二，故事也会随着你的推进不断演化。集结伙伴、整备装备、守护王国，一步步揭开龙之灾厄背后的真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106270/extras/fd24b5bc519f3bbe6e4f964bfaca6a1a.poster.avif?t=1789835931\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106270/extras/fd24b5bc519f3bbe6e4f964bfaca6a1a.webm?t=1789835931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106270/extras/fd24b5bc519f3bbe6e4f964bfaca6a1a.mp4?t=1789835931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >如果你对《地狱卡牌 II》感兴趣，欢迎在 Steam 上把它加入愿望单。 就算还在观望也不妨先点一下：也许我们会给你一个惊喜！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106270/extras/8adf4f10b72c59306d446a4744dc6847.poster.avif?t=1789835931\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106270/extras/8adf4f10b72c59306d446a4744dc6847.webm?t=1789835931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106270/extras/8adf4f10b72c59306d446a4744dc6847.mp4?t=1789835931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >《回归游戏》系列简介</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106270/extras/db580726166cc4583ed9e039e9a3a1ea.avi